spice
* Op-Amp Circuit
R1 2 6 R1_value
R2 4 3 R2_value
C1 2 5 C_value
Vi 1 2 DC Vi_value
X1 0 2 3 Opamp

* Connections
* Node 2 is a common node connecting R1, R2, and the inverting terminal of the op-amp
* Node 3 is the output node V_o
* Node 4 is one terminal of R2
* Node 5 is the other terminal of C
* Node 6 is the ground